Z||000003||1FST2M6||09-27-2000||03:41 PM||||HEY!! sorry i've been fieroless for a while... it'll be back on the road and wreaking havock soon.. they taged the roof of their 99 Z28 on a brick (Noonday Baptist church) sign. just west of 575 but east of 75... about 400yards from the new Los Reyes mexican resaurant. they lost the car in a 4 wheel drift spun it taged the curb lifted the car up on it's side and wiped out the car and both lost their life. the local authorities are gunna nail the SN95 body yellow Mustang GT drive for carless driving, wreckless endangerment and racing.. he'll probly lose his liscense for a year.. he turned him self in yesterday with his father and attorney right behind him. he is 18 the others were 16(driver) and 17(pass). <P>not sure if you or Ramon Otero know but i got rid of my Gold 86 SE and now have an Orange 87 GT. I traded my car with another forum member.. Gt Bastard. ||||reg||1
